WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:10.290
A green campus is not only a pleasant place to study but also a reflection of the values a university holds.
绿色校园不仅是宜人的学习场所，也体现了一所大学秉持的价值观。

00:00:11.090 --> 00:00:17.460
As the largest group on campus, students have both the responsibility and the ability to help build it.
作为校园里人数最多的群体，学生既有责任也有能力参与建设绿色校园。

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:21.480
First, students can save resources in their daily lives.
首先，学生可以在日常生活中节约资源。

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:33.600
Turning off lights and air conditioners when leaving classrooms, taking shorter showers and printing on both sides of each sheet may seem like small actions, but together they make a big difference.
离开教室时关掉电灯和空调、缩短淋浴时间、每张纸都双面打印，这些也许看起来是小事，但加在一起作用很大。

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:44.320
In addition, students should reduce waste by bringing their own cups and lunch boxes, sorting garbage correctly and passing on used textbooks to younger students.
此外，学生应该减少浪费：自带水杯和饭盒，正确进行垃圾分类，把用过的课本传给低年级的同学。

00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:54.920
Moreover, those who care deeply about the environment can join green clubs to plant trees, organize recycling campaigns and raise awareness through social media.
而且，那些十分关心环境的同学可以加入环保社团，植树造林，组织回收活动，并通过社交媒体提高大家的环保意识。

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:59.980
In short, building a green campus requires every student’s effort.
总之，建设绿色校园需要每个学生的努力。

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:11.090
If everyone starts with small things and sticks to good habits, the campus will become greener and more beautiful, and these habits will stay with students long after graduation.
如果每个人都从小事做起、坚持良好的习惯，校园就会变得更绿、更美，而这些习惯也会在学生毕业后长久地伴随他们。
